  "pitch": "Deck identity. Gruul ramp-midrange that converts five true accelerants (2 Deathbloom Gardener, 1 Llanowar Loamspeaker, 2 The Weatherseed Treaty) plus land-drop insurance (2 kicked Sprouting Goblin, Rulik Mons' attack trigger) into oversized threats: Shivan Devastator X, Defiler of Vigor's board-wide snowball, Briar Hydra, and a discounted Molten Monstrosity. Six mainboard kicker cards keep the DMU kicker theme live at aggressive rates.",
